# Exercise 2 – File Recovery Using TestDisk

## Objective
To recover deleted or damaged files and analyze partitions
using TestDisk.

## Tool Used
- TestDisk

## Description
TestDisk is a data recovery utility that can recover lost
partitions and help recover files from damaged or deleted
file systems.

## Procedure
1. Launch TestDisk.
2. Create a log file.
3. Select the target storage device.
4. Select the appropriate partition table type.
5. Choose Analyse.
6. Perform a partition search.
7. Examine the detected partitions/files.
8. Recover the required files to a separate destination.

## Result
Deleted/missing files or partitions were successfully identified
and recovered using TestDisk.

